  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut the cauliflower into small florets. Slice the carrot into thin rounds. Place the cauliflower, carrot, All-American spice blend and a drizzle of olive oil on a lined oven tray.\n• Season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Roast until tender and golden, 15-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/604ed40d5b46d448431bd4cd/step-0ef3bcd7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the cauliflower is roasting, drain the sweetcorn. Slice the lime into wedges. Heat a large frying pan over a high heat. Add the corn kernels and cook, tossing occasionally, until charred, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a plate.\n• TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the kernels are \"popping\" out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/604ed40d5b46d448431bd4cd/step-c6a68185.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine the shredded cabbage mix, charred corn, garlic aioli, the salt, a squeeze of lime juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Microwave the mini flour tortillas on a plate for 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/604ed40d5b46d448431bd4cd/step-223c42fb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop the coriander. Bring everything to the table to serve. Build your tacos by filling with slaw, roasted cauliflower and carrot. Drizzle over the mild chipotle sauce and squeeze over some lime juice. Garnish with the coriander.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/604ed40d5b46d448431bd4cd/step-079f084e.jpg"
    }
  ]
